From: LM-G820N Developer <dev@lmg820n.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] v4l2: disable the request notifier on completion

A completed request fd remains ready until reinitialization. Disable its
notifier before signaling completion to deliver one event per queue cycle.

diff --git a/src/libcamera/v4l2_request.cpp b/src/libcamera/v4l2_request.cpp
--- a/src/libcamera/v4l2_request.cpp
+++ b/src/libcamera/v4l2_request.cpp
@@ -124,0 +125 @@
+	fdNotifier_.setEnabled(false);
